  "abstract": "Validates an EFC regime-transition parameterization against DESI DR2 BAO data with cross-validation against Pantheon+ supernovae and cosmic chronometers. The transition model (z_L1L2 = 1.01, alpha_L2 = 0.045) yields Delta-chi-squared = -22.01 for two additional parameters, surviving rigorous conditional hold-out validation.",
  "keywords": [
    "DESI DR2",
    "BAO",
    "regime transition",
    "Pantheon+",
    "cosmic chronometers",
    "cross-validation",
    "EFC"
  ],
  "efc_context": {
    "track": "empirical_validation",
    "regime_relevance": "L1-L2 transition at z ~ 1",
    "epistemic_layer": "A"
  },
